# Copy to app/.env.local. Only non-secret values belong here (Vite exposes VITE_* to the browser).
# No model keys ever go in the app: all model calls happen in the service.
#
# VITE_API_BASE:
#   (empty)               same origin. In `npm run dev` /api is proxied to http://localhost:8080
#                         (override with ANVESHAN_API_PROXY). On Cloud Run the service serves app + API.
#   http://host:port      call a service directly (the service must allow CORS for this origin).
#   mock                  canned SYNTHETIC responses in the browser (see `npm run dev:mock`).
VITE_API_BASE=
